(6370171, 939483, 16106, '<td valign="top">The narrow depth of field pops your subject off the background, but the resulting loss of clarity in the bill hurts a bit. I can make out the ridges in the bill that act to filter krill, but they are just slightly out of focus. nice color contrast and framing.</td>', 'The narrow depth of field pops your subject off the background, but the resulting loss of clarity in the bill hurts a bit. I can make out the ridges in the bill that act to filter krill, but they are just slightly out of focus. nice color contrast and framing.', '2011-04-01 16:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
