(6371214, 944003, 43774, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of this:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=285757" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/431/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_285757.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/431/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_285757.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/431/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_285757.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>It seems a bit too overprocessed for my tastes but it''s still a very good photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-08 07:57:23.</i></td>', 'Reminds me of this:  It seems a bit too overprocessed for my tastes but it''s still a very good photo.', '2011-04-03 00:43:02.000000', '2011-04-08 08:57:23.000000', 1),
