(6371301, 944013, 113156, '<td valign="top">Although these look like a nice pair of shoes, and the photo is sharp enough, i don''t think the subject matter is worthy of a free study, maybe a shoe challenge would be more appropriate. 5</td>', 'Although these look like a nice pair of shoes, and the photo is sharp enough, i don''t think the subject matter is worthy of a free study, maybe a shoe challenge would be more appropriate. 5', '2011-04-03 07:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
