(6371973, 943921, 28359, '<td valign="top">Why a 5 not a 6: The shot is technically very good for the most part. Colors are great, sharp, nice dof. The problem for me is there is nothing to lead me through the shot. Like a visual leading line to take me to a place or a subject or anything for my eyes to follow. My eyes are all over the place and can''t tie into the shot.  Just an opinion....ace<br/> <br/>Had to come back and bump to a 6. Again it''s well done. If I had above, It would easily been 7 or 8 for me.</td>', 'Why a 5 not a 6: The shot is technically very good for the most part. Colors are great, sharp, nice dof. The problem for me is there is nothing to lead me through the shot. Like a visual leading line to take me to a place or a subject or anything for my eyes to follow. My eyes are all over the place and can''t tie into the shot.  Just an opinion....ace Had to come back and bump to a 6. Again it''s well done. If I had above, It would easily been 7 or 8 for me.', '2011-04-03 23:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
