(6372473, 943470, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice. I really like this composition. Of course there''s the pleasing curvature of the line from the top right, but the angle of the shot plus the brightness of the snow (because of said angle) toward the top convey a much greater sense of depth than what''s visible. As though it were a vast, arctic expanse.<br/> <br/>And accurately named. It''s a great photo to just stare at for a while. Great stuff.</td>', 'Nice. I really like this composition. Of course there''s the pleasing curvature of the line from the top right, but the angle of the shot plus the brightness of the snow (because of said angle) toward the top convey a much greater sense of depth than what''s visible. As though it were a vast, arctic expanse. And accurately named. It''s a great photo to just stare at for a while. Great stuff.', '2011-04-04 10:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
