(6373019, 943927, 108580, '<td valign="top">Highly unusual scene. Exceptionally well photographed. Would also be nice to paint this with light and a shorter exposure for a completely different feel and impact. Great work. (Post previous comment...I now know where this is, it was nagging at me when I saw the dead trees and mountains...I drove past there in Dec 2010...near Villiersdorp, Western Cape on the way to Hermanus, I forget the name of the dam?)</td>', 'Highly unusual scene. Exceptionally well photographed. Would also be nice to paint this with light and a shorter exposure for a completely different feel and impact. Great work. (Post previous comment...I now know where this is, it was nagging at me when I saw the dead trees and mountains...I drove past there in Dec 2010...near Villiersdorp, Western Cape on the way to Hermanus, I forget the name of the dam?)', '2011-04-04 17:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
