(6373740, 941316, 28359, '<td valign="top">Why a 5 not a 6: The player at the bottom is distraction and interferes with the subject. In sport photography the higher scoring shots for me have action in it. If this shot even with the player at the bottom had a the puck in flight and the player attempting to catch/block or some kind of movement I''d scored it higher. The technical aspects as far a color/sharpness/composition is fine. (the stick in the top right could had been cloned out, my eye wonders over that way)....ace</td>', 'Why a 5 not a 6: The player at the bottom is distraction and interferes with the subject. In sport photography the higher scoring shots for me have action in it. If this shot even with the player at the bottom had a the puck in flight and the player attempting to catch/block or some kind of movement I''d scored it higher. The technical aspects as far a color/sharpness/composition is fine. (the stick in the top right could had been cloned out, my eye wonders over that way)....ace', '2011-04-04 22:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6373751, 943363, 28359, '<td valign="top">Why a 5 not a 6: For the most part this is a Great image. Composition is good, it tells a story for me. The flash washed out the colors pretty much in the lower third of the image. You have red eye flash issues in her eyes. Mostly lighting issues for me. A good B&amp;W treatment would had done well for this shot.</td>', 'Why a 5 not a 6: For the most part this is a Great image. Composition is good, it tells a story for me. The flash washed out the colors pretty much in the lower third of the image. You have red eye flash issues in her eyes. Mostly lighting issues for me. A good B&W treatment would had done well for this shot.', '2011-04-04 23:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6373768, 943737, 28359, '<td valign="top">Why a 5 not a 6: To me the  crop is just to tight. The lighting is flat which makes the contrast and colors a little flat. No real pop.  Since the shot itself doesn''t tell me a story I went to the title. From the title it tells me the eye is the main subject. The composition doesn''t take me there. Not a bad image but it doesn''t do anything for me.....Just an opinion....ace</td>', 'Why a 5 not a 6: To me the  crop is just to tight. The lighting is flat which makes the contrast and colors a little flat. No real pop.  Since the shot itself doesn''t tell me a story I went to the title. From the title it tells me the eye is the main subject. The composition doesn''t take me there. Not a bad image but it doesn''t do anything for me.....Just an opinion....ace', '2011-04-04 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6373867, 941002, 3102, '<td valign="top">Shame it''s so small... I probably would have scored this pretty high had it been larger.</td>', 'Shame it''s so small... I probably would have scored this pretty high had it been larger.', '2011-04-04 23:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
