(6374913, 943847, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, interesting, fresh and delightfully anti-DPC cliché.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely picture, interesting, fresh and delightfully anti-DPC cliché.  Thank you.', '2011-04-05 12:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374915, 942726, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I just like this a lot.  A proper photograph.  Thank you.</td>', 'Well I just like this a lot.  A proper photograph.  Thank you.', '2011-04-05 12:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374959, 940105, 118396, '<td valign="top">I like that this is simple and uncluttered and I think there is a perfect amount of negative space.  Very calming.</td>', 'I like that this is simple and uncluttered and I think there is a perfect amount of negative space.  Very calming.', '2011-04-05 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374981, 943841, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting of this photo could be improved. The light is very hard, and causing some tough shadows and highlights to work with (for instance, the hair shadow in front of the eye).</td>', 'I think the lighting of this photo could be improved. The light is very hard, and causing some tough shadows and highlights to work with (for instance, the hair shadow in front of the eye).', '2011-04-05 13:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374984, 943889, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute setup, especially the bubbles.</td>', 'Cute setup, especially the bubbles.', '2011-04-05 13:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374986, 943050, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. The lines through the scene moving in all different directions make the sense of chaos very high.</td>', 'Nicely composed. The lines through the scene moving in all different directions make the sense of chaos very high.', '2011-04-05 13:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374988, 943847, 114225, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the epiphany is? Is it that one shouldn''t text while walking up stairs?</td>', 'I wonder what the epiphany is? Is it that one shouldn''t text while walking up stairs?', '2011-04-05 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374989, 941330, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool dramatic lighting. I don''t know if you intended this or not, but the foreground ball is really drawing a lot of my attention.</td>', 'Very cool dramatic lighting. I don''t know if you intended this or not, but the foreground ball is really drawing a lot of my attention.', '2011-04-05 13:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374991, 942497, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the little dabs of color in this scene really stand out from the greys and tans.</td>', 'I like how the little dabs of color in this scene really stand out from the greys and tans.', '2011-04-05 13:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374993, 943924, 114225, '<td valign="top">A cool view, with nice depth of field. Maybe it''s just my monitor, but I cannot pick out an eyeball on the bird, which is a bit disconcerting.</td>', 'A cool view, with nice depth of field. Maybe it''s just my monitor, but I cannot pick out an eyeball on the bird, which is a bit disconcerting.', '2011-04-05 13:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374994, 943944, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the sharpness, especially in the wings. I wonder if this scene could be more powerful with a less tight crop, so we could see more context.</td>', 'Nice job with the sharpness, especially in the wings. I wonder if this scene could be more powerful with a less tight crop, so we could see more context.', '2011-04-05 13:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374995, 943232, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done HDR. The rays of the sun are fantastic, particularly how they filter through the bush.</td>', 'Beautifully done HDR. The rays of the sun are fantastic, particularly how they filter through the bush.', '2011-04-05 13:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6374998, 941942, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy how the direction of movement plays against the reflection and shadow. That all combines to give a classical triangle in the composition.</td>', 'I really enjoy how the direction of movement plays against the reflection and shadow. That all combines to give a classical triangle in the composition.', '2011-04-05 13:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375002, 940508, 114225, '<td valign="top">The play on soft vs strong is very cool indeed.</td>', 'The play on soft vs strong is very cool indeed.', '2011-04-05 13:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375004, 943714, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. You captured this with the perfect lighting conditions.</td>', 'Very cool. You captured this with the perfect lighting conditions.', '2011-04-05 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375006, 941711, 114225, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable. I like how the sun is highlighting his white fur. I can only imagine with spring, that fur won''t stay white for long :)</td>', 'Absolutely adorable. I like how the sun is highlighting his white fur. I can only imagine with spring, that fur won''t stay white for long :)', '2011-04-05 13:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375009, 943909, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice path shot. I feel the HDR effect may be just slightly overdone for my tastes. It''s hard to achieve that perfect balance on a scene like this.</td>', 'Very nice path shot. I feel the HDR effect may be just slightly overdone for my tastes. It''s hard to achieve that perfect balance on a scene like this.', '2011-04-05 13:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375011, 941855, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and mood to this image.</td>', 'Wonderful tones and mood to this image.', '2011-04-05 13:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375014, 943751, 114225, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to wrap my brain around what my eyes are seeing. Unfortunately, for a shot like this, that isn''t a good thing :-/</td>', 'Took me a while to wrap my brain around what my eyes are seeing. Unfortunately, for a shot like this, that isn''t a good thing :-/', '2011-04-05 13:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375046, 943690, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait of a bald eagle.  The composition is fantastic and the background helps set the bird off nicely.  I typically don''t comment much on the technical aspects of a photo but this one has a couple very noticeable elements that stand out for me.  Since I have a little background in framing, this particular composition is going to run into a minor problem if you decide to mat and frame the print.  The beak is going to be right up on the edge of the mat unless you have some additional image available that was cropped off to make this composition.  There is also a prominent halo around the bird that may be a result of post processing either as a sharpening artifact or possibly from adding additional blur to the background.  At any rate, I gave this photo a 9 because I like the subject and overall approach to the final image... nice work :)</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait of a bald eagle.  The composition is fantastic and the background helps set the bird off nicely.  I typically don''t comment much on the technical aspects of a photo but this one has a couple very noticeable elements that stand out for me.  Since I have a little background in framing, this particular composition is going to run into a minor problem if you decide to mat and frame the print.  The beak is going to be right up on the edge of the mat unless you have some additional image available that was cropped off to make this composition.  There is also a prominent halo around the bird that may be a result of post processing either as a sharpening artifact or possibly from adding additional blur to the background.  At any rate, I gave this photo a 9 because I like the subject and overall approach to the final image... nice work :)', '2011-04-05 14:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375049, 943740, 772, '<td valign="top">Great photo... here''s a perfect example of a well-executed square composition with the point of interest dead center in the frame.  The tilt of the seal''s head creates a fantastic dynamic for this composition.  I had originally voted this shot a 9 but upon further inspection I can''t find anything that should keep it from being a 10.  Great work :)</td>', 'Great photo... here''s a perfect example of a well-executed square composition with the point of interest dead center in the frame.  The tilt of the seal''s head creates a fantastic dynamic for this composition.  I had originally voted this shot a 9 but upon further inspection I can''t find anything that should keep it from being a 10.  Great work :)', '2011-04-05 14:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375053, 943684, 772, '<td valign="top">Birds make such great subjects for photos... This is definitely one of the more unique bird photos I have seen in a while.  I love the composition and I suppose the element of this image that grabs me the most is the lighting.  The warmth of that light is what makes this shot unusual... 10 from me :)</td>', 'Birds make such great subjects for photos... This is definitely one of the more unique bird photos I have seen in a while.  I love the composition and I suppose the element of this image that grabs me the most is the lighting.  The warmth of that light is what makes this shot unusual... 10 from me :)', '2011-04-05 14:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375054, 943726, 121789, '<td valign="top">This looks like the quirky guest at a formal dinner - the one who will not make a poor decision no matter how much she drinks, but will still be the life of the party . . . I love this picture - 9</td>', 'This looks like the quirky guest at a formal dinner - the one who will not make a poor decision no matter how much she drinks, but will still be the life of the party . . . I love this picture - 9', '2011-04-05 14:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375056, 943404, 121789, '<td valign="top">HALO!! This looks like it might be a first jump since completing the training . . . day time, Hollywood . . . this evokes much emotion for me - good capture, Jumper! 9</td>', 'HALO!! This looks like it might be a first jump since completing the training . . . day time, Hollywood . . . this evokes much emotion for me - good capture, Jumper! 9', '2011-04-05 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375067, 939400, 121789, '<td valign="top">This photo is either a sequel or a prequel to this one <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=923654" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1307/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_923654.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1307/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_923654.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1307/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_923654.jpg"/></a>. The emptiness is more vast with the use of B/W and creative vignette. I am still trying to articulate what this does for me - I really like it; a fave and a 9.</td>', 'This photo is either a sequel or a prequel to this one . The emptiness is more vast with the use of B/W and creative vignette. I am still trying to articulate what this does for me - I really like it; a fave and a 9.', '2011-04-05 14:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375090, 943356, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a message here, but I''m not totally sure what that message is. Kinda worries me.</td>', 'There is a message here, but I''m not totally sure what that message is. Kinda worries me.', '2011-04-05 15:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375093, 943006, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great face!</td>', 'Great face!', '2011-04-05 15:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
