(6376615, 944025, 69034, '<td valign="top">I am trying not to rate this higher cause I recently read the Da Vinci Code.  The Louvre is beautiful and I love the composition and angle used in the shot.</td>', 'I am trying not to rate this higher cause I recently read the Da Vinci Code.  The Louvre is beautiful and I love the composition and angle used in the shot.', '2011-04-06 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
