(6376903, 943784, 76335, '<td valign="top">An interesting still life. These kinds of compositions thrive on little details to be found. The narrow, selective focus obliterates most of those, so I''m not sure I get it.</td>', 'An interesting still life. These kinds of compositions thrive on little details to be found. The narrow, selective focus obliterates most of those, so I''m not sure I get it.', '2011-04-06 17:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
