(6377503, 943951, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is a great take on this spot. Every time I''m there I struggle with how to get what has to be a great shot but something a bit different. This is really well composed and processed. Lovely reflection. Good one.</td>', 'This is a great take on this spot. Every time I''m there I struggle with how to get what has to be a great shot but something a bit different. This is really well composed and processed. Lovely reflection. Good one.', '2011-04-07 07:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
