(6377835, 940508, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Really interesting portrait(s) with an unusual but very effective POV. The lighting is stand-out too. The chick cracks me up with it''s unintimidated directness.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: i''d have perhaps reduced some of the red coloration from his head.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very unusual portrait. I like it.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Really interesting portrait(s) with an unusual but very effective POV. The lighting is stand-out too. The chick cracks me up with it''s unintimidated directness. Critical stuff: i''d have perhaps reduced some of the red coloration from his head. Overall: A very unusual portrait. I like it.', '2011-04-07 15:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
