(6377944, 942667, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. The tightly framed bench and leading lines pull (or push) the viewer into the flowery light. The suggestion, of course, is that the viewer should get off the bench and explore the beauty of spring. It''s no wonder your bench is empty. A seven for you.</td>', 'I love the composition. The tightly framed bench and leading lines pull (or push) the viewer into the flowery light. The suggestion, of course, is that the viewer should get off the bench and explore the beauty of spring. It''s no wonder your bench is empty. A seven for you.', '2011-04-07 18:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
