(6378014, 943295, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile.  I think it''s because I see three fun-filled spirits of some kind involved in a joyful dance.  They''ve only stopped momentarily here because you''re not allowed to see them move.  As soon as you turn your back...</td>', 'This makes me smile.  I think it''s because I see three fun-filled spirits of some kind involved in a joyful dance.  They''ve only stopped momentarily here because you''re not allowed to see them move.  As soon as you turn your back...', '2011-04-07 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
