(6378137, 943610, 114285, '<td valign="top">What an awesome pic. THe guy in the b.ground just paddling away, totally unaware of his surroundings so it seems, highly commended. Love the grainy look, although a lot of Dpers don''t, they don''t like to experiment, glad you did what you like.</td>', 'What an awesome pic. THe guy in the b.ground just paddling away, totally unaware of his surroundings so it seems, highly commended. Love the grainy look, although a lot of Dpers don''t, they don''t like to experiment, glad you did what you like.', '2011-04-07 22:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
