(6378141, 943626, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great pic, she has gorgeous eyes, blue like her shirt, good match...just wish she had longer hair, She would look even more stunning, but I guess she likes it short, each to their own.</td>', 'Great pic, she has gorgeous eyes, blue like her shirt, good match...just wish she had longer hair, She would look even more stunning, but I guess she likes it short, each to their own.', '2011-04-07 22:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
