(6378236, 943232, 109227, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge; the muted tones and softness really portrays morning.  Bumping up.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge; the muted tones and softness really portrays morning.  Bumping up.', '2011-04-07 23:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6378237, 940307, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great way to make a strong statement. In my opinion, a large part of photography is in recognizing the interesting shot when it presents itself. I''m afraid however, that I find the execution of this to be somewhat flat looking and not well composed. The biggest issue is way too much empty sky at the top that does not do anything for the scene. I''d suggest cropping in a lot closer to focus the eye on the elements that this is about. A bit of tweaking to make it pop a bit might help as well. I do think you''ve got some great material here to work with.</td>', 'Great way to make a strong statement. In my opinion, a large part of photography is in recognizing the interesting shot when it presents itself. I''m afraid however, that I find the execution of this to be somewhat flat looking and not well composed. The biggest issue is way too much empty sky at the top that does not do anything for the scene. I''d suggest cropping in a lot closer to focus the eye on the elements that this is about. A bit of tweaking to make it pop a bit might help as well. I do think you''ve got some great material here to work with.', '2011-04-07 23:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6378239, 944007, 100831, '<td valign="top">oh WOW that''s good!!!</td>', 'oh WOW that''s good!!!', '2011-04-07 23:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
