(6378241, 943907, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a cool shot of a handsome animal. Looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54446" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hahn23</a> effort. If this is not from Richard, then please know to take that as a compliment.</td>', 'What a cool shot of a handsome animal. Looks like a  hahn23 effort. If this is not from Richard, then please know to take that as a compliment.', '2011-04-07 23:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6378248, 939400, 83313, '<td valign="top">A landscape that comes off as an abstract. The simplicity of the scene really works and I like the very subtle texture. My eye just keeps moving around. Normally that is a problem meaning my eye can''t find the subject, but in this case, it is just taking it all in. Well done. I''m going to hazard a guess that this might be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54645" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bspurgeon</a> entry.</td>', 'A landscape that comes off as an abstract. The simplicity of the scene really works and I like the very subtle texture. My eye just keeps moving around. Normally that is a problem meaning my eye can''t find the subject, but in this case, it is just taking it all in. Well done. I''m going to hazard a guess that this might be a  bspurgeon entry.', '2011-04-07 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
