(6378258, 940029, 93283, '<td valign="top">I think this image was really close to being great... What I love is the tone, color, and overall feel. There is also some haloing around the tower that others may ding you for, personally though, I like it. What I don''t like is the fact that the silo is cut off and it is tilted, as well as the horizon line. Best of luck 6</td>', 'I think this image was really close to being great... What I love is the tone, color, and overall feel. There is also some haloing around the tower that others may ding you for, personally though, I like it. What I don''t like is the fact that the silo is cut off and it is tilted, as well as the horizon line. Best of luck 6', '2011-04-07 23:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6378260, 944028, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful abstract that is tied in perfectly with the title... Well Done, 10</td>', 'This is a wonderful abstract that is tied in perfectly with the title... Well Done, 10', '2011-04-07 23:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
