(6378264, 943936, 93283, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. Good composition and exposure. It has a certain grittiness that is appealing as well. My only knock would be that the end of the pier is out of focus, personally, I would have liked to have seen it sharp. That''s a personal opinion though, and the way it fades out still works. Good luck. 7</td>', 'I really like this image. Good composition and exposure. It has a certain grittiness that is appealing as well. My only knock would be that the end of the pier is out of focus, personally, I would have liked to have seen it sharp. That''s a personal opinion though, and the way it fades out still works. Good luck. 7', '2011-04-07 23:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6378266, 941711, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG, he made a little heart with the space between his paws!  Too darned cute for words.</td>', 'OMG, he made a little heart with the space between his paws!  Too darned cute for words.', '2011-04-08 00:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
