(6378268, 942497, 93283, '<td valign="top">To me, this is really an interesting shot, and would probably work well as a stock photo. My only critique would be that its shot from the height of someone just standing there. That works very well for stock photography, which is why I made that suggestion. For challenges like this, usually a perspective that is abnormal works better, like maybe 2 feet off the ground. Either way I like the image, its a strong 7 in my book. Best of luck!</td>', 'To me, this is really an interesting shot, and would probably work well as a stock photo. My only critique would be that its shot from the height of someone just standing there. That works very well for stock photography, which is why I made that suggestion. For challenges like this, usually a perspective that is abnormal works better, like maybe 2 feet off the ground. Either way I like the image, its a strong 7 in my book. Best of luck!', '2011-04-08 00:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6378269, 944029, 124815, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2011-04-08 00:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
