(6378277, 943176, 93283, '<td valign="top">Wow, its really rare to see a minimalist type shot with a wild elephant in it. I think popularity wise, this shot would score better with the entire image in focus... But for me, I love the fact that the elephant is isolated and the background is blurry. Anyway, just wanted to stop and say that I love the shot, its a 10 to me!</td>', 'Wow, its really rare to see a minimalist type shot with a wild elephant in it. I think popularity wise, this shot would score better with the entire image in focus... But for me, I love the fact that the elephant is isolated and the background is blurry. Anyway, just wanted to stop and say that I love the shot, its a 10 to me!', '2011-04-08 00:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
