(6378312, 942339, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your JPEG compression. Your file size is only 20k and I see compression artifacts all over the place in this. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.</td>', 'Watch your JPEG compression. Your file size is only 20k and I see compression artifacts all over the place in this. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.', '2011-04-08 00:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6378316, 940902, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems a little soft on the detail, with some faint pixelation around some edges so I looked at the file size.  Your file size is only 17k and you could have used up to 300k for this challenge. There is excessive JPEG compression taking away a lot of good detail. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.</td>', 'This seems a little soft on the detail, with some faint pixelation around some edges so I looked at the file size.  Your file size is only 17k and you could have used up to 300k for this challenge. There is excessive JPEG compression taking away a lot of good detail. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.', '2011-04-08 00:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
