(6378481, 939567, 83313, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first entry and your first ribbon! <br/> <br/>Ok, so it was the brown ribbon, but that leaves nowhere to go but up, and you did get some good feedback. Freestudies are always tough anyway, so you picked a hard one for your first challenge. In a freestudy, you have to totally blow some people away just to get them to say <i>"eh, it''s ok."</i> Looking forward to seeing what you do in the future.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first entry and your first ribbon!  Ok, so it was the brown ribbon, but that leaves nowhere to go but up, and you did get some good feedback. Freestudies are always tough anyway, so you picked a hard one for your first challenge. In a freestudy, you have to totally blow some people away just to get them to say "eh, it''s ok." Looking forward to seeing what you do in the future.', '2011-04-08 01:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
