(6378559, 943815, 62357, '<td valign="top">I love this and scored it high.  Paul''s comment below mirrors my own feelings, but he has articulated it much better than I ever could.</td>', 'I love this and scored it high.  Paul''s comment below mirrors my own feelings, but he has articulated it much better than I ever could.', '2011-04-08 01:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6378560, 943923, 54645, '<td valign="top">Paul described my perception perfectly. I didn''t vote, enjoying this for the first time. The subtle tilt nails the mood for me, adds weight of despair. Is he being pushed back or is he struggling to get back on track? Fantastic capture Brian; I never quite believed you when you said you toss the good ones before they hit your hard drive, this cements it. You are full of it!</td>', 'Paul described my perception perfectly. I didn''t vote, enjoying this for the first time. The subtle tilt nails the mood for me, adds weight of despair. Is he being pushed back or is he struggling to get back on track? Fantastic capture Brian; I never quite believed you when you said you toss the good ones before they hit your hard drive, this cements it. You are full of it!', '2011-04-08 01:48:26.000000', NULL, 0),
