(6378628, 943761, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, a newbie winner!  Yep.  I wonder if this Neil fellow knows about the rules and the dates and all that good stuff.  Maybe this will be DQed, yeah, maybe :)  <br/> <br/>Anyway.  Congratulations, it''s a beautiful picture.  It is so clear.  How are you liking the D7000?  I am rather impressed with mine, I get detail where I didn''t know detail existed.</td>', 'Ahhh, a newbie winner!  Yep.  I wonder if this Neil fellow knows about the rules and the dates and all that good stuff.  Maybe this will be DQed, yeah, maybe :)   Anyway.  Congratulations, it''s a beautiful picture.  It is so clear.  How are you liking the D7000?  I am rather impressed with mine, I get detail where I didn''t know detail existed.', '2011-04-08 02:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6378630, 940324, 69668, '<td valign="top">I thought to myself when I saw this image..."that looks alot like the bridge that I use to photograph some people".  Sure enough it is....I love that walk....fun to go there in the summer to when the water is not rushing so hard.  This image was taken from that same bridge looking down.  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=890379" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1221/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_890379.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1221/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_890379.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1221/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_890379.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Great job and I love the toning and expression of your daughter.  She is beautiful!!</td>', 'I thought to myself when I saw this image..."that looks alot like the bridge that I use to photograph some people".  Sure enough it is....I love that walk....fun to go there in the summer to when the water is not rushing so hard.  This image was taken from that same bridge looking down.    Great job and I love the toning and expression of your daughter.  She is beautiful!!', '2011-04-08 02:26:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6378632, 943988, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, very beautiful!  Congratulations.  I particularly like the water, it is so silky and the colours are fantastic.</td>', 'Wow, very beautiful!  Congratulations.  I particularly like the water, it is so silky and the colours are fantastic.', '2011-04-08 02:27:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6378637, 943195, 61961, '<td valign="top">Just going through and commenting on each of the five photos that got a vote of 10 from me this challenge.  Clearly the model''s beauty and the professional looking "art direction" (hair, makeup, etc.) served you well, but I like how this is exposed (lit) and cropped as well.</td>', 'Just going through and commenting on each of the five photos that got a vote of 10 from me this challenge.  Clearly the model''s beauty and the professional looking "art direction" (hair, makeup, etc.) served you well, but I like how this is exposed (lit) and cropped as well.', '2011-04-08 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 0),
