(6378659, 942328, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh - we were all probably shooting at the same time!  Johanna (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a>) and I were there at the same time.  I thought this looked familiar.  And yes, folks, the color really is this rich amazing pink/purple, and the light is unbelievable!</td>', 'Oh my gosh - we were all probably shooting at the same time!  Johanna ( tanguera) and I were there at the same time.  I thought this looked familiar.  And yes, folks, the color really is this rich amazing pink/purple, and the light is unbelievable!', '2011-04-08 02:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
