(6378709, 939360, 30214, '<td valign="top">this is a hell of an image! very lucky weather conditions indeed, and the color coordination between the boat and the bridge is uncanny. congratulations on the high finish, but should have finished much higher! It should be printed big for proper viewing... and I hope 1x takes it, I voted :)</td>', 'this is a hell of an image! very lucky weather conditions indeed, and the color coordination between the boat and the bridge is uncanny. congratulations on the high finish, but should have finished much higher! It should be printed big for proper viewing... and I hope 1x takes it, I voted :)', '2011-04-08 03:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6378710, 943988, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by curtpetguy:</b></div><hr/><i> William, another fantastic landscape, congrats. Are you standing in the creek? Is the forground noise ninja? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I was on a piece of ice which didn''t melt quick enough to trap me. The foreground was soft because of slow shutter, not software.</td>', 'Originally posted by curtpetguy: William, another fantastic landscape, congrats. Are you standing in the creek? Is the forground noise ninja?  I was on a piece of ice which didn''t melt quick enough to trap me. The foreground was soft because of slow shutter, not software.', '2011-04-08 03:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
