(6379518, 943179, 91197, '<td valign="top">I did not vote this one high, mostly because of the light! I d prefer the shadows to be less shadowed and the lit area on the shot to be less highlighted. And for sure the right area of the shot gives me the feeling of a line that seperates the environment! Hope this helps!</td>', 'I did not vote this one high, mostly because of the light! I d prefer the shadows to be less shadowed and the lit area on the shot to be less highlighted. And for sure the right area of the shot gives me the feeling of a line that seperates the environment! Hope this helps!', '2011-04-08 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 0),
