(6379532, 943988, 115307, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red!<br/>I am almost positive I have been to this very spot. My family goes camping in this valley of yosemite every summer. Crazy!</td>', 'Congrats on the red!I am almost positive I have been to this very spot. My family goes camping in this valley of yosemite every summer. Crazy!', '2011-04-08 17:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379535, 939834, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bohemka:</b></div><hr/><i> I could''ve sworn I commented on this last night. I suppose not. Well it''s a hell of a shot. Only thing I might have done differently is deliver a heavy dose of dodge &amp; burn to those clouds to get them to pop a bit and hold up their end of the photo, or crop another 40 pixels or so off the top of the image. The lighting on the peaks is quite nice but the clouds are just kind of blah next to them, yet my eyes keep floating up there for some reason. A tighter crop to remove some of those clouds would make this image more dramatic.<br/> <br/>Before you consider these points, however, please keep in mind you placed nearly 100 spots ahead of me in this challenge. </i></td></tr></table> Thanks, Scott. I agree with the crop but I would not like to make the clouds more dominant as it would take the focus away from the light on the mountains :)</td>', 'Originally posted by bohemka: I could''ve sworn I commented on this last night. I suppose not. Well it''s a hell of a shot. Only thing I might have done differently is deliver a heavy dose of dodge & burn to those clouds to get them to pop a bit and hold up their end of the photo, or crop another 40 pixels or so off the top of the image. The lighting on the peaks is quite nice but the clouds are just kind of blah next to them, yet my eyes keep floating up there for some reason. A tighter crop to remove some of those clouds would make this image more dramatic. Before you consider these points, however, please keep in mind you placed nearly 100 spots ahead of me in this challenge.  Thanks, Scott. I agree with the crop but I would not like to make the clouds more dominant as it would take the focus away from the light on the mountains :)', '2011-04-08 17:58:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379536, 939834, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> I do like black and white landscapes, but I feel like this one needs more black.</i></td></tr></table> Hi, Brian, I don''t usually respond to comments but I was wondering about this one - luminous means full of light, how would black help?</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: I do like black and white landscapes, but I feel like this one needs more black. Hi, Brian, I don''t usually respond to comments but I was wondering about this one - luminous means full of light, how would black help?', '2011-04-08 18:01:23.000000', NULL, 0),
