(6379730, 939360, 52981, '<td valign="top">this was my number 1 shot!!  and a 10.  I dont understand the voters here sometimes.  Great job.</td>', 'this was my number 1 shot!!  and a 10.  I dont understand the voters here sometimes.  Great job.', '2011-04-08 20:49:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379732, 944036, 76335, '<td valign="top">Dammit, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a>, you liked this. Why didn''t you comment? <br/> <br/>The bird leaps from the score lines. Fitting title.</td>', 'Dammit,  bvy, you liked this. Why didn''t you comment?  The bird leaps from the score lines. Fitting title.', '2011-04-08 20:51:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379733, 943602, 52981, '<td valign="top">should have finished higher.  great shot!!</td>', 'should have finished higher.  great shot!!', '2011-04-08 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379742, 942380, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> This laughs in the face of every toothache-inducing little girl portrait ever made. I wonder if her father is named Clive... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Really thought this was a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">clive_patric_nolan</a> image, which, in any case, is a huge compliment.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: This laughs in the face of every toothache-inducing little girl portrait ever made. I wonder if her father is named Clive...  Really thought this was a  clive_patric_nolan image, which, in any case, is a huge compliment.', '2011-04-08 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379750, 943751, 72134, '<td valign="top">Thanks</td>', 'Thanks', '2011-04-08 21:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379764, 943688, 76335, '<td valign="top">A seven from me. So much rhythm and harmony.</td>', 'A seven from me. So much rhythm and harmony.', '2011-04-08 21:28:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379769, 939834, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> I do like black and white landscapes, but I feel like this one needs more black.</i></td></tr></table> Hi, Brian, I don''t usually respond to comments but I was wondering about this one - luminous means full of light, how would black help? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It was figurative and goes back to my statement about wanting more mystery. It doesn''t <i>really</i> need more black. It''s quite perfect. Sorry for the confusion. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-08 20:32:51.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by marnet: Originally posted by bvy: I do like black and white landscapes, but I feel like this one needs more black. Hi, Brian, I don''t usually respond to comments but I was wondering about this one - luminous means full of light, how would black help?  It was figurative and goes back to my statement about wanting more mystery. It doesn''t really need more black. It''s quite perfect. Sorry for the confusion. ', '2011-04-08 21:32:09.000000', '2011-04-08 21:32:51.000000', 0),
(6379790, 939834, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> I do like black and white landscapes, but I feel like this one needs more black.</i></td></tr></table> Hi, Brian, I don''t usually respond to comments but I was wondering about this one - luminous means full of light, how would black help? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It was figurative and goes back to my statement about wanting more mystery. It doesn''t <i>really</i> need more black. It''s quite perfect. Sorry for the confusion. </i></td></tr></table>Aha! You meant dark rather than black. Sorry, I misunderstood.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Originally posted by marnet: Originally posted by bvy: I do like black and white landscapes, but I feel like this one needs more black. Hi, Brian, I don''t usually respond to comments but I was wondering about this one - luminous means full of light, how would black help?  It was figurative and goes back to my statement about wanting more mystery. It doesn''t really need more black. It''s quite perfect. Sorry for the confusion. Aha! You meant dark rather than black. Sorry, I misunderstood.', '2011-04-08 21:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379796, 943840, 30982, '<td valign="top">So sorry to hear of your loss; too soon for her to leave you.  This photograph, even without your notes - evoked a sense of loss to me.  May you look upon it kindly in years to come.</td>', 'So sorry to hear of your loss; too soon for her to leave you.  This photograph, even without your notes - evoked a sense of loss to me.  May you look upon it kindly in years to come.', '2011-04-08 22:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6379821, 943840, 124815, '<td valign="top">Believe it or not, I could not comment on your entry. It transmits so much sadness that I thought of being the last view of a hospitalized person. In Greece! Where else would you have the sea view at hand and of this color?! Very sorry for your loss. Life is undoubtedly cruel for reasons unknown to us.</td>', 'Believe it or not, I could not comment on your entry. It transmits so much sadness that I thought of being the last view of a hospitalized person. In Greece! Where else would you have the sea view at hand and of this color?! Very sorry for your loss. Life is undoubtedly cruel for reasons unknown to us.', '2011-04-08 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
