(6379943, 942328, 128132, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh my gosh - we were all probably shooting at the same time!  Johanna (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a>) and I were there at the same time.  I thought this looked familiar.  And yes, folks, the color really is this rich amazing pink/purple, and the light is unbelievable! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>There were about 5-7 other film/photographers there that day.  I expected to be all alone, little did I know!  It is very cool that we connected online after such an experience and I look forwarding to connecting with you and Johanna more in the future!  Thanks so much for the comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Oh my gosh - we were all probably shooting at the same time!  Johanna ( tanguera) and I were there at the same time.  I thought this looked familiar.  And yes, folks, the color really is this rich amazing pink/purple, and the light is unbelievable!  There were about 5-7 other film/photographers there that day.  I expected to be all alone, little did I know!  It is very cool that we connected online after such an experience and I look forwarding to connecting with you and Johanna more in the future!  Thanks so much for the comment.', '2011-04-09 00:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
