(6380379, 942380, 129195, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> This laughs in the face of every toothache-inducing little girl portrait ever made. I wonder if her father is named Clive... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Really thought this was a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">clive_patric_nolan</a> image, which, in any case, is a huge compliment. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you! I''m really trying to define my own "style" and I had so much fun making this image. Thanks for the 10 as well <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=70896" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">epescala</a></td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Originally posted by bvy: This laughs in the face of every toothache-inducing little girl portrait ever made. I wonder if her father is named Clive...  Really thought this was a  clive_patric_nolan image, which, in any case, is a huge compliment.   Thank you! I''m really trying to define my own "style" and I had so much fun making this image. Thanks for the 10 as well  epescala', '2011-04-09 12:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
