(6415914, 942703, 117474, '<td valign="top">As she said herself there''s a lot of attitude in this image. The eyes stare you down. Very nice. <br/> <br/>The only criticism I can say here is that in your notes you said you got her to spike up her hair. It''s very difficult to see that with the image. It might have been possible to selectively lighten the hair a tad to give the attitude more umph. Perhaps not though. The face is great. It''s the focal point of the image really. So maybe if the hair was more noticable it would have taken away from that. It''s hard to say without seeing what happens to the image when that''s done. <br/> <br/>Perhaps there''s a bit too much of a nose shadow under her nose too. And of her left hand on her arm/shoulder. Though maybe this adds to it. I don''t know. I certainly wouldn''t have taken marks off for it anyway.</td>', 'As she said herself there''s a lot of attitude in this image. The eyes stare you down. Very nice.  The only criticism I can say here is that in your notes you said you got her to spike up her hair. It''s very difficult to see that with the image. It might have been possible to selectively lighten the hair a tad to give the attitude more umph. Perhaps not though. The face is great. It''s the focal point of the image really. So maybe if the hair was more noticable it would have taken away from that. It''s hard to say without seeing what happens to the image when that''s done.  Perhaps there''s a bit too much of a nose shadow under her nose too. And of her left hand on her arm/shoulder. Though maybe this adds to it. I don''t know. I certainly wouldn''t have taken marks off for it anyway.', '2011-05-17 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
